{"hw":"φῆμις","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">φῆμις</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">φῆμις</span>, <span class=\"lex-itype gk\">ιος</span>, <span class=\"lex-gram\">ἡ</span>, poet. for <span class=\"gk\">φήμη,</span> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">speech, talk,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Il.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">10.207</span> </span>; but <span class=\"gk\">ἐς θῶκον πρόμολον δήμοιό τε φῆμιν</span> the <b class=\"lex-tr\">place of talk</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Od.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">15.468</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"3\"><span class=\"lex-n\">2</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">common opinion</b> or <b class=\"lex-tr\">judgement expressed in talk,</b> <span class=\"gk\">χαλεπὴ δ' ἔχε δήμου φ.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">14.239</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">16.75</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">τῶν ἀλεείνω φῆμιν ἀδευκέα</span> their 'bitter <b class=\"lex-tr\">gossip</b>', <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">6.273</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">Κασσάνδραν.. φᾶμις ἔχησι βροτῶν</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Ibyc.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">9</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"4\"><span class=\"lex-n\">b</span> <span class=\"gk\">φ. ἀοιδῶν</span> their <b class=\"lex-tr\">praise,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Euph.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">40</span> </span>: hence, </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"3\"><span class=\"lex-n\">3</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">reputation,</b> <span class=\"gk\">χαλεπὴν δέ τε φῆμιν ὀπάσσει.. γυναιξί</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Od.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">24.201</span> </span>; later of <b class=\"lex-tr\">good report,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Man.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">3.183</span> </span>,<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">237</span> </span>.</div></div>"}